```glsl
double st(float x) { double s = 0.0lf; for (int i = 0; i < 8; i++) s += double(x) * double(x); return s; }
```
# not taken, each with its reason: the trip count is not a constant, the
# sum is read inside the loop, s0 is an f64 computed before the loop
simplify nofile under gt1030, x in [1, 2], n in [1, 100]
```glsl
float nc(float x, int n) { double s = 0.0lf; for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) s += double(x); return float(s); }
```
simplify nofile under gt1030, x in [1, 2]
```glsl
float rd(float x) { double s = 0.0lf; float m = 0.0; for (int i = 0; i < 8; i++) { s += double(x); m = max(m, float(s)); } return m + float(s); }
```
simplify nofile under gt1030, x in [1, 2], y in [3, 4]
```glsl
float s0d(float x, float y) { double s = double(y) * 100.0lf; for (int i = 0; i < 32; i++) s -= double(x); return float(s); }
```
